ERFITTING\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nTrain Size   Train R\u00b2 (mean\u00b1std)    Val R\u00b2 (mean\u00b1std)    \n-----------------------------------------------------------------\n1651         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.6023 \u00b1 0.0321\n3303         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.6512 \u00b1 0.0245\n4954         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.6798 \u00b1 0.0198\n6605         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7012 \u00b1 0.0187\n8257         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7145 \u00b1 0.0165\n9908         1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7256 \u00b1 0.0143\n11559        1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7324 \u00b1 0.0132\n13211        1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7401 \u00b1 0.0121\n14862        1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7445 \u00b1 0.0110\n16512        1.0000 \u00b1 0.0000       0.7489 \u00b1 0.0098"
